Dlaczego `Dispatcher` i `RequestProcessor` w 6.3 wystarczy oznaczyć `@Component`, a `Handler` – nie?
```
@Component @NoArgsConstructor public class Dispatcher { ... }
@Component @AllArgsConstructor public class RequestProcessor { private Dispatcher dispatcher; private List<Handler> handlers; ... }
